<title>CANADA: Hydro-Quebec sets C$350 mln 7.0 pct bond due 2007.</title>
<headline>Hydro-Quebec sets C$350 mln 7.0 pct bond due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hydro-Quebec this morning set a C$350 million 7.0 percent bond due February 15, 2007, said lead manager Levesque Beaubien Geoffrion Inc.</p>
<p>The issue was priced at C$98.118 with a yield of 7.260 percent for a spread of 47 basis points above the Government of Canada 7.0 percent bond due December, 2006.  </p>
<p>The issue will be dated and delivered on October 11, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
